{"id":"9e4f9577b47a056e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-fitconflictgraph.md","title":"Bipartite conflict graph and weighted covers","display":"df-fitconflictgraph — Bipartite conflict graph and weighted covers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-fitconflictgraph","aliases":["27-df-fitconflictgraph"],"display":"df-fitconflictgraph — Bipartite conflict graph and weighted covers","depends_on":["[[27-df-fiterror]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, F+ case","source_printed_pages":"549","source_pdf_pages":"573","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-fitconflictgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-fitconflictgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fitconflictgraph — Bipartite conflict graph and weighted covers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, F+ case"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"549"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"573"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\">\\(a\\leq b\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(a_i\\leq b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(a_i\\leq b_i)\\)</span>。有限权重和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm W_w\">\\(\\mathrm W_w\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in T\\times F\\mid a\\leq b\\},\\qquad H_n(T,F)\\coloneqq(T\\cup F,E_n(T,F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in T\\times F\\mid a\\leq b\\},\\qquad H_n(T,F)\\coloneqq(T\\cup F,E_n(T,F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq T\\cup F\\mid\\forall(a,b)\\in E_n(T,F)\\;(a\\in U\\lor b\\in U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq T\\cup F\\mid\\forall(a,b)\\in E_n(T,F)\\;(a\\in U\\lor b\\in U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T,F,w)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm W_w(U)\\leq\\mathrm W_w(V))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T,F,w)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm W_w(U)\\leq\\mathrm W_w(V))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow V=U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow V=U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.17 的 positive 类证明，印刷页 549 / PDF 第 573 页。此处显式要求 T∩F=∅，使 T、F 成为真正不相交的二部顶点。MinVC 表示权重最小，IrredVC 表示包含关系下极小，两者不能混同；零权时可从任一最小权覆盖删去冗余顶点而保持最小权。相交样本在本目录中先由固定代价恒等式消去冲突点；若用带标签顶点副本，则需另行编码，不能把它与无标记集合公式混用。原页公式已视觉核对；图是有序边的关系编码，不需要调用目录外图原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-fiterror]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$；$a\\leq b$ 表示 $\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(a_i\\leq b_i)$。有限权重和 $\\mathrm W_w$ 见 [[27-df-fiterror]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(a_i\\leq b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm W_w","display":false},{"tex":"E_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in T\\times F\\mid a\\leq b\\},\\qquad H_n(T,F)\\coloneqq(T\\cup F,E_n(T,F)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq T\\cup F\\mid\\forall(a,b)\\in E_n(T,F)\\;(a\\in U\\lor b\\in U)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T,F,w)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm W_w(U)\\leq\\mathrm W_w(V))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\mid\\forall V\\in\\mathrm{VC}_n(T,F)\\;(V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow V=U)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2050,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-fitconflictgraph|df-fitconflictgraph — Bipartite conflict graph and weighted covers]]"},{"id":"988675a000b87840","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $U\\subseteq T_0\\cup F_0$；$\\mathrm{MinVC}_n,\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n$ 定义见 [[27-df-fitconflictgraph]]；最优函数族、递增函数类和扩张族分别见 [[27-df-bestfit]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-extension]]。$T_U,F_U,g_U$ 由下式给出。"}],"outgoing":["00d5aa0e1574d0b4"]}